{"title": "Greater Kushigo Counter", "pageid": 28288, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Greater_Kushigo_Counter", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Greater Kushigo Counter</b> is a passive feature that lets users retaliate against melee attacks that miss.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer can use a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to make an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/45px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Unarmed Strike\">Unarmed Strike</a> against any attacker that misses. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation\" title=\"Vest of Soul Rejuvenation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Vest_of_Soul_Rejuvenation\" title=\"Vest of Soul Rejuvenation\">Vest of Soul Rejuvenation</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Greater Kushigo Counter</b> triggers <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a>, if used during a player character's turn.\n<ul><li>If this attack is done while Extra Attack (from a normal attack) is activated, both Extra Attacks (from normal attack and Greater Kushigo Counter) are lost.\n<ul><li>Sentinel: Vengeance attack from an enemy can trigger Greater Kushigo Counter at the wrong moment and cause the loss of both Extra Attacks.</li></ul></li>\n<li>On Honour mode, monks with an extra <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> (at least from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/30px-Haste_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/40px-Haste_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp/20px-Haste_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Haste_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste\" title=\"Haste\">Haste</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\">Elixir of Bloodlust</a>) can get Extra Attack only once per turn, while characters without extra actions get Extra Attack for both the normal attack and the Greater Kushigo Counter. Thus, both a hasted and a non-hasted monk can get 4 attacks per turn using Greater Kushigo Counter.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200007\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited